<title>USA: TABLE-International Specialty Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-International Specialty Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, N.J. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Specialty Products Inc</p>
<p>			(Millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					Second Quarter	First Half</p>
<p>					1997     1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net sales			$197.8   $185.0   $389.0   $370.6</p>
<p> Operating income		 39.5     38.0     76.3     72.2</p>
<p>Equity in earnings of</p>
<p>   joint venture		   1.4	1.7	2.7	3.1</p>
<p> Net income			 25.5     22.6     48.7     42.5</p>
<p> Earnings per common share    0.27     0.23     0.51     0.44</p>
<p>Avg shrs</p>
<p>   (thousands)		  96,044   97,489   96,257   97,617</p>
<p> EBITDA(A)			  60.3     55.5    116.4    107.1</p>
<p>(A) EBITDA represents earnings before income taxes, increased by interest expense, depreciation and goodwill amortization.</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1997 and Q2 1996 nets include $5.4 million charge for goodwill amortization and stepped-up depreciation.</p>
<p>Six months 1997 and six months 1996 nets include $10.9 million charge for goodwill amortization and stepped-up depreciation.</p>
</text>
